<br />They were sent out to &quot;recruit&quot; powered individuals to become new citizens for Dawn.&nbsp; Perhaps they stumbled upon a <strong>young </strong>Vanessa and want to take her, but Visionary steps in, and THAT&#39;S why they are nemeses?

&nbsp;

Edit: It would likely be much easier to recruit Visionary when she&#39;s young, than to deal with her heroic older alternate timeline self... Is what I&#39;m getting at.

